@ Start

- Melusina
  The sanctum mirror reflects a gentle shimmer. Floating within the glass is a woven garment of tidal thread.

- Sir Melodious
  The Resonant Weave—woven from sorrow-seam silk and dawn mist. Try it on, Melusina.

* Don the Resonant Weave outfit. | -> EquipOutfit
* Inspect the fabric and stitches.  | -> InspectFabric

<@> InspectFabric

- Melusina
  The seams pulse softly with the heartbeat of the sea. It carries an uplifting buoyancy.

- Sir Melodious
  Every stitch is tuned to wind and water. When you wear it, the air itself will catch your fall.

-> EquipOutfit

<@> EquipOutfit

- Melusina
  The fabric aligns with my rhythm. I feel lighter, as if the breeze answers my steps.

$ Notify melodia:item:give:item.outfit.melusina_v2:1
$ Notify melodia:reward:reward.wardrobe.first_outfit
$ Notify melodia:stat:intent.wardrobe.elegance:melodia_elegance:3
$ Notify melodia:flag:flag.wardrobe.outfit_equipped:true
$ Notify melodia:flag:flags.melusina.sorrow_seam_restored:true

- Sir Melodious
  Magnificent! The Sorrow Seam is restored, and the currents of the sky recognize your form. You can now Glide effortlessly across the chasm!

$ Notify melodia:questcomplete:quest.wardrobe.equip_outfit:flag.wardrobe.equip_completed:reward.wardrobe.first_outfit:intent.wardrobe.complete:checkpoint.wardrobe.complete

@ Finish

- .
  Melusina equips the Resonant Weave. Her traversal capabilities expand with the power of Glide.

$ End
